{180}{Why would we? As I said, we have an interest in any job worth doing. The only way for you to become involved in important jobs is through us. But there's always places to rob, stores and such. We're mostly concerned with the big coin.}{Why would we? As I said, we have an interest in any job worth doing. The only way for you to become involved in important jobs is through us. But there's always places to rob, stores and such. We're mostly concerned with the big coin.}{}{}{}{lf4 1 }
